    "notes": {
        "2bc74cb9-8007-4381-b64d-5c1ae26e3521": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": -272,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⏱ Timing\n\nThe first Wait lets the notification channels (enabled at flow start) become active and the polling trigger record its baseline on the first tick: a contact created before that is never reported as new. The other Waits give Bigin time to deliver the notifications in order. Do not remove them."
        }
